    {
      "source": "Note that an actual refresh will only happen when\n<a href=\"#requiresRefresh()\"><code>requiresRefresh()</code></a> returns <code>true</code>.",
      "translation": "注意，实际的刷新仅在 `<a href=\"#requiresRefresh()\"><code>requiresRefresh()</code></a>` 返回 `<code>true</code>` 时才会发生。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Only invoked if a refresh check has found that a refresh is required\n(that is, <a href=\"#requiresRefresh()\"><code>requiresRefresh()</code></a> has returned <code>true</code>).",
      "translation": "仅在刷新检查发现需要刷新时才会调用（即，<a href=\"#requiresRefresh()\"><code>requiresRefresh()</code></a> 返回了 <code>true</code>）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Implements the <a href=\"Refreshable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aop.target.dynamic\"><code>Refreshable</code></a> interface in order to allow for\nexplicit control over the refresh status.",
      "translation": "实现<a href=\"Refreshable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aop.target.dynamic\"><code>Refreshable</code></a>接口，以便显式控制刷新状态。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The default implementation always returns <code>true</code>, triggering\na refresh every time the delay has elapsed. To be overridden by subclasses\nwith an appropriate check of the underlying target resource.",
      "translation": "默认实现始终返回 `<code>true</code>`，从而在每次延迟到期时触发刷新。子类应重写此方法，以对底层目标资源进行适当的检查。",
      "count": 2
    },
